                      "line": 5,
                      "heading": "B.B.A. in Finance"
                    },
                    "text": "Below is a comprehensive listing of all courses offered for the Bachelor of Business Administration in Finance at Cendara University. Each course entry includes the course code, title, description, prerequisites, and credit hours."
                  }
                ],
                "sections": []
              },
              {
                "title": "FINA 101: Introduction to Financial Systems",
