                "location": {
                  "line": 18,
                  "heading": "Department of Finance and Accounting"
                },
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "location": {
                      "line": 19,
                      "heading": "ACCT 103: Principles of Accounting I"
                    },
                    "text": "Description:\nIntroduction to financial accounting concepts, including the accounting cycle, preparation of financial statements, analysis of assets, liabilities, and equity. Emphasis on understanding how financial information supports business decision-making."
